# Bound the EAS upload archive.
#
# EAS roots its archive at the GIT ROOT, so this file must live here — an
# .easignore inside app/ cannot exclude anything above it.
#
# .claude/worktrees is the reason this exists: git worktrees created for
# parallel work live INSIDE the repo and carry their own node_modules and
# native build output (8.4 GB when this was written), which pushed the archive
# past EAS's 2 GB limit and failed the build outright. It is excluded from git
# via .git/info/exclude, which is LOCAL-only and which EAS does not honour —
# hence the explicit entry here.
.claude/
# Native projects are regenerated by prebuild on the builder.
app/ios/
app/android/
app/node_modules/
node_modules/
# Local scratch, captures and store assets — never needed by a build.
store/
docs/media/
*.mov
*.mp4
*.heic
# Signing material belongs in the credentials service, never the source archive.
app/credentials.json
app/credentials/
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
secrets/
CLAUDE.md

# Local assistant handoffs may contain private operational details.
CLAUDE.local.md

# Private operational notes and test identities must stay off cloud builders.
docs/BUILD_LOG.md
docs/memory/DECISIONS.md
docs/memory/KNOWN_ISSUES.md
**/*.local.md
app/lib/__tests__/.atv-identity.json
app/lib/__tests__/.atv-code.txt
scripts/player-test/state/
output/
*.key
*.pem
*.jks
*.apk
*.ipa
*.aab
*.tar.gz
.env*.local
app/play-service-account.json
*service-account*.json
